# Aether Studio

A modern and responsive portfolio website built using **Python**, **Flask**, **HTML5**, **CSS3**, **JavaScript**, **Jinja2**, and **SQLite**.

## ✨ Features

- Modern and responsive design
- Clean and minimal user interface
- Portfolio showcase
- About section
- Contact section
- Mobile-friendly layout
- Flask backend
- Template rendering using Jinja2

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- Python
- Flask
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Jinja2
- SQLite

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
Aether-Studio/
│── static/
│── templates/
│── app.py
│── README.md
```

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

### Navigate to the project

```bash
cd Aether-Studio
```

### Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Run the application

```bash
python app.py
```

Open:

```
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

## 🎯 Purpose

This project demonstrates responsive web development with Flask and modern frontend technologies while maintaining clean and organized code.

